;;; teaches the model how to BUILD one — how to turn a single verb into a family
;;; of runnable lessons. Without this chapter the model can read the reference
;;; but cannot reproduce its shape. Applies to Motoi.
;;;
;;; Anchor verb throughout: `fold` (SRFI-1, element-first). Its full canonical
;;; 15-program grid lives in 33-higher-order.slat; this chapter uses it as the
;;; worked example for every shape. `filter` and `iota` appear as second voices.
;;;
